    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<div>[1]J.A. Buchmann, Introduction to Cryptography, Springer.</div>\n\n<div>[2] H. Delfs, H. Knebl , Introduction to Cryptography, Springer.</div>\n\n<div>[3] B.A. Forouzan, Cryptography and Network Security (網路安全與密碼 學概論), McGraw Hill, 滄海.</div>\n\n<div>[4] J. Hoffstein, J. Pipher, J.H. Silverman, An Introduction to Mathematical Cryptography, Springer.</div>\n\n<div>[5] N. Koblitz, A Course in Number Theory and Cryptography, Springer.</div>\n\n<div>[6] N. Koblitz, Algebraic Aspects of Cryptography, Springer.</div>\n\n<div>[7] W. Stallings, Cryptography and Network Security: Principles and Prac tices, 4th. ed. Pearson International Edition, 2006.</div>\n\n<div>[8] L.C. Washington, Elliptic Curves, Chapman&amp;Hall/CRC.</div>\n\n<div>[9] 黃明祥, 林詠章, 資訊與網路安全概論,McGrawHill. [10] 結城浩, 密碼學與比特幣原理,碁峯</div>\n\n<div>.....等等</div>\n",
